OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with some sunshine, leaving
OL,7,Fa mostly clear and dry night to come.
OL,8,FFeeling rather cool compared to recent
OL,9,Fnights with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,12,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,13,FCloud increasing through the day,
OL,14,Fthough staying largely dry with a low
OL,15,Frisk of an isolated light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
