OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThough
OL,6,Fremaining a little cooler and fresher,
OL,7,Fthere will be some warm spells of
OL,8,Fsunshine at times, but an isolated
OL,9,Fshower possible during Saturday.
OL,10,FPossibly turning wetter on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
